ts on exercise tolerance in individuals with metabolic disorders, such as Glycogen Storage Disease Type VI (GSDVI), although the results of these studies have been mixed. Overall, creatine is recognized for its role in supporting muscle function and performance across various contexts.", "THYMIDINE PHOSPHORYLASE:Thymidine phosphorylase is an enzyme whose activity is crucial for the metabolism of thymidine, and its deficiency is linked to MNGIE.", "HEMATOPOIETIC STEM CELL TRANSPLANT:Hematopoietic Stem Cell Transplant (HSCT) is a medical procedure that involves the transplantation of hematopoietic stem cells to treat a variety of diseases, particularly hematological malignancies and solid tumors. Additionally, HSCT is being investigated as a potential treatment option to address the enzymatic deficiency associated with Mitochondrial Neurogastrointestinal Encephalomyopathy (MNGIE). This procedure represents a significant therapeutic approach in the field of regenerative medicine and offers hope for patients with challenging medical conditions.", "DIETARY ANTIOXIDANTS:Dietary antioxidants, including idebenone and vitamin E, have been studied for their potential clinical benefits in mitochondrial diseases.", "SÍNDROME DE COLON IRRITABLE:El síndrome de colon irritable es un trastorno gastrointestinal que se caracteriza por síntomas como dolor abdominal y cambios en los hábitos intestinales. Este trastorno puede estar relacionado con la sensibilidad al gluten. Además, es importante diferenciar el síndrome de colon irritable de enfermedades mitocondriales, ya que aunque ambos pueden presentar síntomas gastrointestinales, son condiciones distintas.", "DISTROFIA MUSCULAR CONGÉNITA:Distrofia muscular congénita por déficit de merosina is a genetic disorder that affects muscle function and is relevant in the differential diagnosis of mitochondrial diseases.", "LEUCODISTROFIAS:Leucodistrofias are a group of disorders affecting the white matter of the brain, included in the differential diagnosis of mitochondrial diseases.", "ENFERMEDAD DE KRABBE:Enfermedad de Krabbe is a type of leukodystrophy that must be differentiated from mitochondrial diseases.", "ENFERMEDAD DE CANAVAN:Enfermedad de Canavan is a genetic disorder that affects the brain and is included in the differential diagnosis of mitochondrial diseases.", "ENFERMEDAD DE ALEXANDER:Enfermedad de Alexander is a type of leukodystrophy that must be differentiated from mitochondrial diseases.", "LEUCOENCEFALOPATÍA CON SUSTANCIA BLANCA EVANESCENTE:Leucoencefalopatía con sustancia blanca evanescente is a disorder affecting the brain's white matter, relevant in the differential diagnosis of mitochondrial diseases.", "POLINEUROPATÍA DESMIELINIZANTE INFLAMATORIA CRÓNICA:", "TIMIDIN FOSFORILASA:Thymidine phosphorylase is an enzyme whose activity is crucial for correcting metabolic damage in patients with MNGIE."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}